    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p> <br><br>Join our discord, by clicking on the banner above, where you can:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Follow the development of Crime or Punishment!</strong><br>Get updates and sneak previews.<br></li><li><strong>Give us your feedback!</strong><br>Give us your feedback on the Demo, and help contribute to improving the game.<br></li><li><strong>Ask the developers your questions!</strong><br>Ask the team at Scale Issue any question you have about the development of the game or game dev in general.<br></li><li><strong>Join The Community!</strong><br>Join our community, participate in community events, and be a part of bringing Crime Or Punishment to life!</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>There\u2019s been a murder\u2026<br>And you <strong>better</strong> make sure the killer ain\u2019t caught!<br><br>Crime or Punishment is a top-down 2D detective adventure game that inverts the detective genre; instead of solving crime, you must cover it up instead!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/4d88151a388fc1af930b13fb275063a8.avif?t=1726665275\" width=650 height=93 /></span><br>You enable it. As a crooked detective working for the mob, it\u2019s your job to fool the boys in blue and help the criminal get away with it! But be careful you don\u2019t mess up; the mob doesn\u2019t tolerate failure!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/ec7f524c6e986383b1a557ae4867b890.poster.avif?t=1726665275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/ec7f524c6e986383b1a557ae4867b890.webm?t=1726665275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/ec7f524c6e986383b1a557ae4867b890.mp4?t=1726665275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/4bd0a28bcc4a1d46b71be70b141d3335.avif?t=1726665275\" width=650 height=93 /></span><br>Plenty of scum to filter through in this shady city. As you investigate the crime scene and learn about enigmatic characters, you\u2019ll get more context to what\u2019s their deal. Every dame and fella has a story to tell; the question is, how are you gonna use that against them?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/3a89843cdee44dcedf203415aabdae39.poster.avif?t=1726665275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/3a89843cdee44dcedf203415aabdae39.webm?t=1726665275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/3a89843cdee44dcedf203415aabdae39.mp4?t=1726665275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/c780d2ab5684f344e7a3cb5dd8110c81.avif?t=1726665275\" width=650 height=93 /></span><br>Alter clues and meddle with evidence to get your guy off the hook! Do a good enough job, and it\u2019ll be a fat paycheck from your illicit patron. But screw up, and you\u2019ll be in the obituaries faster than you can say \u201csorry\u201d!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/6339fa931ebf8ce6d171b213b99541e7.poster.avif?t=1726665275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/6339fa931ebf8ce6d171b213b99541e7.webm?t=1726665275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/6339fa931ebf8ce6d171b213b99541e7.mp4?t=1726665275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/c2552a2f802b349af70ab7f6747d1b17.avif?t=1726665275\" width=650 height=93 /></span><br>Immerse yourself in a brooding tone, accentuated by sultry jazz and witty one-liners. But don\u2019t let the charm fool you! This is a world full of cutthroats and crooks, all with motives that are far from pure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/d2ac895204c8cf977af8ded983885e84.poster.avif?t=1726665275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/d2ac895204c8cf977af8ded983885e84.webm?t=1726665275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907090/extras/d2ac895204c8cf977af8ded983885e84.mp4?t=1726665275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
